  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>Like <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Razor_Bugs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Razor Bugs\">Razor Bugs</a>, Thud Bugs are insects engineered by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong\" title=\"Yuuzhan Vong\">Yuuzhan Vong</a> to serve as ranged weapons. A thrown Thud Bug is treated as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Ranged)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Simple Weapon (Ranged)\">Simple Weapon (Ranged)</a>, not a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown Weapon\">Thrown Weapon</a>, for purposes of determining <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p><p>Additionally, the wielder can choose to deal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stun\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stun\">Stun</a> damage instead of normal damage against a target at Point-Blank or Short <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
